+Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 00:43:34 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH 10/13] wifi: mt76: mt7603: avoid accessing Frame Queue Control
+ on pending reset
+
+---
+ mt7603/beacon.c | 6 ++++++
